# Markup compatibility (`mc:`, ECMA-376 Part 3): the source of src/mc.rs (`cargo xtask
# codegen`; the grammar is in xtask/src/codegen.rs). A reader takes the first branch it can
# use; what it can use is the reader's to say.

ns mc http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006

view AlternateContent AlternateContent mc | `mc:AlternateContent`: the same content as one or more choices and a fallback.
  children choices Choice Choice
  child fallback Fallback Fallback
  order Choice Fallback
view Choice Choice mc | `mc:Choice`: content that needs the namespaces `Requires` names.
  attr requires str Requires
  all content Any
view Fallback Fallback mc | `mc:Fallback`: content every reader understands.
  all content Any
view Any * | Any element, read by what it holds.
